---
title: Caramel Apple Spice
image: https://i.pinimg.com/736x/2d/be/fa/2dbefac067ee324dc7fa42f4d4144793.jpg
servings: 2
---

In a #medium pot{}, heat @apple cider{3%cups}(juice can work too) and @Torani brown sugar cinnamon syrup{3%tbsp} at medium-low heat until it steams, but does not boil. Top with @?whip cream{}, @?cinnamon{}, and @?caramel sauce{} as desired.